Domain Entity StaffLeave
    documentation "This entity represents the recording of the dates of staff leave (e.g., sick leave, personal time, vacation)."
    date BeginDate
        documentation "The begin date of the staff leave.  Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is part of identity
    date EndDate
        documentation "The end date of the staff leave.  Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is optional
    descriptor StaffLeaveEventCategory
        documentation "The code describing the type of leave taken."
        is part of identity
    shared string Reason
        documentation "Expanded reason for the staff leave."
        is optional
    bool SubstituteAssigned
        documentation "Indicator of whether a substitute was assigned during the period of staff leave."
        is optional
    domain entity Staff
        documentation "The staff associated with this leave event."
        is part of identity